## 6. Default Visibility (Pre-0.8)

```solidity
// VULNERABLE (Solidity < 0.8)
contract Vulnerable {
    function sensitiveAction() {  // Defaults to PUBLIC!
        // ...
    }
}

// SECURE - always explicit
contract Secure {
    function sensitiveAction() internal {
        // ...
    }
}
```

