## Audit Checklist

- [ ] Are all state-changing functions protected?
- [ ] Is tx.origin avoided for authentication?
- [ ] Do modifiers properly revert on failure?
- [ ] Are role hierarchies correctly enforced?
- [ ] Are signatures protected against replay?
- [ ] Are visibility modifiers explicit on all functions?
- [ ] Are upgradeable contracts properly protected from re-init?
- [ ] Is delegatecall restricted to trusted targets?
- [ ] Is ownership transfer two-step?
- [ ] Can timelocks be bypassed?
- [ ] Are privileged addresses EOAs or multisigs/timelocks?
